      "content": "but it's not just feelings, it's actually the math. i look at what we owe, what i'm making, and what it costs just to keep me fed and housed... it literally doesn't add up. i'm a net loss. i feel like if i just disappeared, that's one less mouth to feed and one less person to struggle for. wouldn't it be more logical for them to just move on without me?",
