      "content": "it's just that grief is a feeling, and money is a reality. you can't pay rent with love. i see them struggling so hard just to keep us afloat because of my mistakes. it feels like i'm just prolonging their misery by staying. wouldn't it be more selfless to just... step aside and let them start over without this constant pressure?",
